<div class="mandarin-hanzi">明天</div>
<div class="mandarin-pinyin">míngtiān</div>

''Meaning:'' tomorrow  
''Part of speech:'' noun; time word

!! In context
我们明天去学校。 — Wǒmen míngtiān qù xuéxiào. — We’re going to school tomorrow.

!! Usage note
A time expression ('tomorrow') that can precede the subject or predicate without an English-style preposition 'on'.
